I am going to the penis museum.

31
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:25.240
Yeah.

32
00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:27.240
And we're going to need to let people know how that went.

33
00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:28.100
Mm-hmm.

34
00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:28.880
All right.

35
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:29.620
Well, listen.

36
00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:30.760
On that note.

37
00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:31.740
On that note.

38
