00:32:30.780 --> 00:32:36.240
Honestly, if you look at how many episodes you're in and improvise so well, you know?

719
00:32:36.660 --> 00:32:37.780
That's very sweet.

720
00:32:37.960 --> 00:32:39.920
I mean, I, yeah, it's so nice.

721
00:32:40.400 --> 00:32:46.500
I started taking acting classes because I, I would hire in between, like when we'd be

722
00:32:46.500 --> 00:32:51.620
shooting, I would go back to New York and I had this acting coach named Anya Saffer,

723
00:32:51.760 --> 00:32:55.820
who is this, who I would go, shout out to Anya Saffer, because I'd never gone to acting

724
00:32:55.820 --> 00:32:56.340
school or anything.

