00:32:56.480 --> 00:33:00.080
So I would go do like scenes from Tennessee Williams plays and like take voice classes

726
00:33:00.080 --> 00:33:02.580
and do like Alexander technique and all this shit.

727
00:33:02.700 --> 00:33:07.280
Cause I was like, I just felt I had such deep imposter syndrome because I hadn't done

728
00:33:07.280 --> 00:33:07.640
it before.

